     - **Catalyst Dependence:** The optimal temperature depends on the catalyst used (e.g., polyether glycol catalysts, metal oxides).
     - **Side Reactions:** At very high temperatures, side reactions (e.g., chain scission, formation of oligomers) can occur, reducing yield and product quality.
