1. **Fully Ionized Equation:**  
   \[ \text{H(C}_7\text{H}_5\text{O}_2\) + \text{NaOH} \rightarrow \text{H}_2\text{O} + \text{NaC}_7\text{H}_5\text{O}_2 \]  
   
