     \( L = \frac{V}{A} = \frac{0.00166 \text{ m}^3}{0.075 \text{ m}^2} = 0.0208 \text{ m} \)  
   - **Time constant (τ)**:  
     The time constant for the lumped parameter model is given by:  
     \[
     \tau = \frac{m \cdot c}{h \cdot A} = \frac{1.2 \text{ kg} \times 385 \text{ J/kg K}}{56.8 \text{ W/m²K} \times 0.075 \text{ m}^2} = \frac{486 \text{ J K}}{4.26 \text{ W}} = 121.7 \text{ s}
     \]  
