     \[
     A_{vf}' = \frac{A_v'}{1 - m_v} = \frac{1.57}{1 - 0.1} = \frac{1.57}{0.9} \approx 1.68 \text{ V}
     \]

4. **Percentage Change in Closed-Loop Gain:**
