   \[ B_2 = B = \frac{\mu_0 N_1 I_1}{2\pi \ell} \]
   The magnetic flux \( \phi_2 \) through coil 2 is given by:
   \[ \phi_2 = B_2 A = \frac{\mu_0 N_1 I_1 A}{2\pi \ell} \]

